# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SupportPilot .gitignore
# NOTE: cache/index/* (embedding matrix + example bank) and cache/llm/* are
# intentionally COMMITTED so that `make reproduce` meets the PRD's 15-minute
# budget on cold clone. Delete them to force full recomputation (~20 min).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- data: raw + interim are rebuilt from mirrors; processed golden data IS
# committed for reproducibility (see data/processed notes in README).
data/raw/*.parquet
data/interim/
# committed for the 15-minute reproduction budget:
# - data/processed/retrieval_cases_labelled.jsonl (LLM-labelled corpus)
# - data/processed/{conversations,retrieval_cases,golden_pool,validation}.jsonl
#   are rebuilt quickly from raw (~1 min) but are small; regenerate is cheap.
# hand-labelled golden data IS committed (data/golden/*.jsonl, review sheets)
# derived but committed for reproducibility: golden_set.jsonl

# --- generated evaluation artifacts (regenerate with make evaluate)
reports/predictions.json
reports/agent_traces.json

# --- Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.python-version

# --- environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
cache/llm/tmp/
pip-wheel-metadata/

# --- temporary local scripts (project convention)
.tmp_*.py
.tmp_*.json

# --- notebooks checkpoints
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- node (prettier layer runs via npx, no committed lockfile)
node_modules/
package-lock.json
